    "Add the ones she gets wrong in real use; the fix is an example under [gate.examples] in the config,",
    "or in KIND/TOPIC in strawberryd/systemone.py when it should ship for everyone.",
    "Run it against your own config: 'save this song' and 'play my running playlist' only mean something",
    "with a library server configured, and are read right when its adapter is loaded (ADAPTERS.md)."
